                                            "code": null,
                                            "comment": "",
                                            "message": "<div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(var(--sn-tinymce_content-background,var(--now-form-field--background-color,var(--now-color_background--primary,var(--now-color--neutral-0,255,255,255))))); color: rgb(var(--sn-tinymce_content-text,var(--now-form-field--color,var(--now-color_text--primary,var(--now-color--neutral-18,22,27,28))))); font-size: 10pt;\">The Automated Software Installation Flow in ServiceNow streamlines software deployment within your workspace, ensuring seamless, scalable, and efficient installations. By leveraging automated workflows and predefined deployment rules, this system minimizes manual intervention, accelerates software provisioning, and ensures that the right applications are installed on the right devices at the right time.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>"
